# Two different guarantees live in this file, and CI run 36360310447 proved both were missing.
#
# 1. Evidence whose identity is its raw bytes must never be line-ending converted. The fixture ELF
#    files, the MAP they were generated with, and the linker script behind them are hashed by
#    `fixtures/manifest.json`, and a test compares that hash to the bytes on disk. Git only
#    converts a file it has classified as text, so every text classification is written down here
#    rather than left to the machine's `core.autocrlf`.
#
# 2. A text file checked out on Windows must hold the same bytes it holds on Linux and macOS.
#    With no rule, `core.autocrlf=true` smudged `p0-dual-region.ld` from the recorded LF bytes to
#    CRLF, and the hash test failed on the checkout rather than on the fixture.

# --- Byte-identical evidence: no conversion, on any platform -------------------------------
*.elf    binary
*.bin    binary
*.o      binary
*.a      binary
*.sqlite binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.ico    binary

# A linker MAP is hashed as bytes by the fixture manifest and parsed as text by the MAP adapter.
# `-text` keeps the committed bytes in every checkout and still lets `git diff` read it as lines.
# It is deliberately not the `binary` macro, which would also disable delta packing.
*.map    -text

# --- Source and configuration text: LF on checkout, everywhere ------------------------------
# Extension list follows what the repository actually tracks. Anything new that is hashed as
# evidence belongs in the section above; anything new that is text belongs here.
golden/**   text eol=lf
*.c         text eol=lf
*.css       text eol=lf
*.csv       text eol=lf
*.h         text eol=lf
*.html      text eol=lf
*.js        text eol=lf
*.json      text eol=lf
*.ld        text eol=lf
*.lock      text eol=lf
*.md        text eol=lf
*.npmrc     text eol=lf
*.py        text eol=lf
*.rs        text eol=lf
*.sql       text eol=lf
*.toml      text eol=lf
*.ts        text eol=lf
*.tsx       text eol=lf
*.txt       text eol=lf
*.yaml      text eol=lf
*.yml       text eol=lf
.gitignore     text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
SHA256SUMS     text eol=lf
